    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55170",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MESSENGER.\nMadam, according as your ladyship desired,\nBy message craved, so is Lord Talbot come.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55170/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55170/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 53,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55170/line-3",
          "start": 54,
          "end": 96,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2140857,
        "end": 2140988,
        "line": 78654,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap12/p@55170",
        "anchor": "sceneII_12.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MESSENGER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55305",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COUNTESS.\nAnd he is welcome. What, is this the man?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55305/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55305/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 51,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2140992,
        "end": 2141073,
        "line": 78660,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap12/p@55305",
        "anchor": "sceneII_12.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "COUNTESS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55390",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MESSENGER.\nMadam, it is.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55390/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55390/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 24,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2141077,
        "end": 2141131,
        "line": 78665,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap12/p@55390",
        "anchor": "sceneII_12.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MESSENGER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55448",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COUNTESS.\nIs this the scourge of France?\nIs this the Talbot, so much fear’d abroad\nThat with his name the mothers still their babes?\nI see report is fabulous and false.\nI thought I should have seen some Hercules,\nA second Hector, for his grim aspect,\nAnd large proportion of his strong-knit limbs.\nAlas, this is a child, a silly dwarf!\nIt cannot be this weak and writhled shrimp\nShould strike such terror to his enemies.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55448/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55448/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 40,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55448/line-3",
          "start": 41,
          "end": 82,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55448/line-4",
          "start": 83,
          "end": 132,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55448/line-5",
          "start": 133,
          "end": 168,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55448/line-6",
          "start": 169,
          "end": 212,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_12.3/p@55448/line-7",
          "start": 213,
          "end": 250,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
